{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1082585-room-101-music","id":1082585,"title":"Room 101 music","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-23T06:57:40-07:00","id":1082585,"title":"Room 101 music","content":"A certain Progenitor in my campaign has gotten too cozy with the Reality Deviants and wasn't particularly cautious about getting caught by the Symposium (also he was ratted out by one of the other characters).<br /> \u2026so he's gonna have a little trip to Room 101 for some &quot;continuing education for the purposes of recertification and license renewal.&quot;<br /> <br /> What should I put on my iPod for mood music for this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T07:01:35-07:00","id":1082587,"title":"","content":"My reflex is to use really unpleasant, seizure-inducing dubstep, but that's because I'm me and I actually like that kind of music (and what's better is I think that player doesn't). I come in here for input that takes my train of thought to stations I wouldn't otherwise stop at.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T07:01:44-07:00","id":1082588,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ein kleines bisschen Horrrshow&quot; by &quot;Die toten Hosen&quot;<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1887-colognian","name":"Colognian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T07:17:00-07:00","id":1082595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Colognian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1082585-room-101-music?p=1082588#post1082588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Ein kleines bisschen Horrrshow&quot; by &quot;Die toten Hosen&quot;<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Listening on youTube right now. I am totally buying this album! I think he might love it, instead of finding it torture, but it sets a mood for sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12930,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","user":"GogariGlenRoss","date":". 04-23-2017, 10:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T07:59:43-07:00","id":1082613,"title":"","content":"I council going the opposite direction. You want mind-numbing elevator muzak. It contrasts well with the brainwashing horror.<br /> <br /> It's like being trapped in a dentist waiting room. Except instead of drilling the patient's teeth, they drill the patient's <i>mind</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T12:31:15-07:00","id":1082737,"title":"","content":"Why have music? I made my room 101 a sensory deprivation tank. It's so quiet soon all the subject hears is their heart beat, the thoughts in their head (or are their thoughts?).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-23T16:59:18-07:00","id":1082830,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I think I like the elevator muzak idea best. To quote Frank Burlingame from the NWO Revised Prologue, , 'The ultra-smooth, metallic everything has been done to death.' The more non-threatening it is, I think the more threatening it becomes, if you catch my meaning?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Outpost Phoenix</a>, an Non-Affiliated, Live-Action Star Trek <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zwnyzm\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> Sim. New players are always welcome!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","name":"Arzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T06:55:34-07:00","id":1082996,"title":"","content":"Make the following playlist:<br /> <br /> Orinoco Flow (Sail Away)<br /> &quot;Stuck in the Middle With You&quot; - Stealer's Wheel<br /> &quot;We've Only Just Begun.&quot; - The Carpenters<br /> &quot;I Remember You&quot; - Slim Whitman<br /> &quot;Happy Heart&quot; - Andy Williams<br /> &quot;Mr. Sandman&quot; - The Chordettes<br /> &quot;Heat of the Moment&quot; - Asia<br /> &quot;All You Need is Love&quot; - The Beatles<br /> &quot;Put On Your Sunday Best&quot; -- Hello Dolly Soundtrack<br /> <br /> Of course, if in the scene it becomes necessary for his rehabilitation experts to make him think he's going to be let out, only to bring him back in, there's <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ\" target=\"_blank\">only one song</a> to appropriately play the moment he has hope snatched away...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I seem to have acquired a site for running play by post games. This is unexpected and frightening and come watch either the glorious play or the magnificent train wreck:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">The Malkavian Madness Network</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1515-benjcano","name":"BenjCano","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1276"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-24T08:26:26-07:00","id":1083023,"title":"","content":"How did I know what that last one was going to be? ;^)<br /> <br /> <br /> Come to think of it, 'Easy Listening' songs might be a good flavour too. 'Turn On Your Heartlight,' for example, might be a good addition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Outpost Phoenix</a>, an Non-Affiliated, Live-Action Star Trek <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zwnyzm\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> Sim. New players are always welcome!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","name":"Arzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-25T06:14:21-07:00","id":1083430,"title":"","content":"Teen pop music.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11894-shushu","name":"Shushu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T06:36:54-07:00","id":1085772,"title":"","content":"Grrrr. He's not coming tonight so we're roleplaying his Room 101 over Facebook chat instead. I'll have to save this for next time (the way these knuckleheads act, there will almost certainly be a next time).<br /> <br /> I posted a series of corporate training videos on YouTube, instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T10:07:12-07:00","id":1085816,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hey Mickey&quot; by Toni Basil on infinite repeat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T19:36:59-07:00","id":1086006,"title":"","content":"Pretty much anything from That Poppy's 33:6.<br /> <br /> But if you really want to weird your players out, chose this part <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Tk3YUoaoIGQ?t=35m20s\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/Tk3YUoaoIGQ?t=35m20s</a><br /> <br /> Imagine the scene.<br /> <br /> The room opens up to an incredibly white space, a single comfortable chair sits in the centre, with a simple warm and inviting sign stating &quot;please take a seat&quot;. The air is warm, and the chair inviting. The doors close behind the subject with barely a sound as the subject is met with a sudden urge to rest.<br /> <br /> They take a seat, and from within the corners of their mind a soothing voice speaks softly.<br /> <br /> &quot;You have done so well&quot; it says.<br /> &quot;Please take this moment to relax and reflect on your hard work. Would you like some tea?&quot;<br /> Before they have a chance to respond, their choice appears before them, perfectly made and at the exact right temperature.<br /> &quot;Your service to the union has been a valuable and significant one. The Union is grateful for your services&quot;<br /> Everything within the room is comforting to the subject, they feel as though they could leave any time they want, but would very much prefer to stay.<br /> <br /> &quot;We understand you have concerns, and the Union understands that perfection has yet to be attained. We value your concerns and would be happy to discuss them with you.&quot;<br /> <br /> At this point, the subject is invited to speak their mind, talk openly about how they feel. The conversation continues and the subject will feel as though they are truly being listened to, that their concerns are being met. That the Union is there for them, and they are there for the union.<br /> <br /> If this does not work, then the chair will shift into restraints, the soft white glow falls away, and a more mechanical scene comes into view. Perhaps a more direct approach is required.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T21:22:45-07:00","id":1086057,"title":"","content":"Army of Me by Bjork is my tecnocracy theme","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}